Third-party software
--------------------

Norbelys binaries and images include third-party components under their own licenses:

- Rust crates listed in Cargo.lock. Their licenses are reviewed with cargo-deny (deny.toml):
  permissive licenses, plus MPL-2.0 for cssparser, cssparser-macros, selectors and dtoa-short
  (used unmodified through lol_html; source: https://crates.io).
- SQLite (public domain), bundled through rusqlite for the tracking spool.
- DuckDB (MIT), bundled into the separate `analytics` image only.
- JavaScript packages listed in bun.lock, for the dashboard and marketing site.

Published container images carry a software bill of materials (SBOM) and provenance
attestations generated at build time (.github/workflows/images.yml).
